ARDY Core showcase assets and released model

This application includes the CoreSkeleton27 neutral-joint and skin assets from:

    NVIDIA ARDY
    https://github.com/nv-tlabs/ardy
    source revision 693f74d

The upstream source and bundled Core skeleton/skin assets are distributed under Apache-2.0. A copy
of that license is retained at public/assets/ardy/LICENSE. The browser-native core-skin bundle is a
deterministic format conversion of joints.p and skin_standard.npz; their SHA-256 identities are
recorded in core-skin.json.

The separately downloaded ARDY-Core-RP-20FPS-Horizon40 checkpoint is pinned by immutable Hugging Face
revision and is licensed under the NVIDIA Open Model License identified on its model page. The model
weights are range-streamed at runtime and are not copied into this source tree.
